### STREAMS - GET
GET {{HostAddress}}/streamsapi/server/posters/test HTTP/2
Accept: application/json

### STREAMS - GET
GET {{HostAddress}}/streamsapi/client/posters/test HTTP/2
Accept: application/json


### STREAMS - POST
POST {{HostAddress}}/streamsapi/server/posters HTTP/2
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "description": "Test Poster"
}

### STREAMS - POST
POST {{HostAddress}}/streamsapi/client/posters HTTP/2
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "description": "Test Poster"
}


### STREAMS - GET - COMPRESSION
