### STREAMS - GET - CANCELLATION
GET {{HostAddress}}/streamsapi/server/trailers/test HTTP/2
Accept: application/json

### STREAMS - GET - CANCELLATION
GET {{HostAddress}}/streamsapi/client/trailers/test?cid=1&&timeout=30&httptimeout=0 HTTP/2
Accept: application/json



### STREAMS - GET - EXCEPTION HANDLING
GET {{HostAddress}}/streamsapi/server/posters/test/exception HTTP/2
Accept: application/json

### STREAMS - GET - EXCEPTION HANDLING
GET {{HostAddress}}/streamsapi/client/posters/500error/exception HTTP/2
Accept: application/json



### STREAMS - GET - POLLY  RETRY - Valid posterId = 4
